# large raw sticker source art (local-only; feeds scripts/extract-doodles.py)
/assets/stickers/
# Commit every PNG the DOODLES registry references (src/gifts/love-receipt/
# love-receipt-doodles.ts); ignore the rest of the extracted catalog. A doodle
# missing here 404s on Vercel even though it renders locally, so keep this list
# in sync when adding a registry entry.
/public/stickers/doodles/*
!/public/stickers/doodles/doodle-dashes-lavender.png
!/public/stickers/doodles/doodle-dashes-lavender-right.png
